(b) an arrow-typed parameter, zero-parameter lambda first:
  gb(z, 1.0) = b: rank 0, gb(z, v) = b: rank 1, gb(z, m) = b: rank 2
(c) an Any parameter, ONE-parameter lambda first:
  gc(o, m) = c: rank 2
(d) an Any parameter, the lambda second:
  gd(m, z) = d: rank 2
(a) an Any parameter, zero-parameter lambda first (the reproduction):
  ga(z, m) = a: rank 2
(f) mixed arity, the value parameter renamed:
  gf(z, m) = f: rank 2, gf(z, 1.0, v) = f: dyadic
(e) mixed arity, `r` both a nat and a value parameter:
  ge(z, m) = e: rank 2, ge(z, 1.0, v) = e: dyadic
